  "summary": "Customers express frustration when seat assignments change unexpectedly, such as moving back rows or switching to middle seats despite availability [#tk_2379113] [#tk_519951]. Automated upgrades often preselect undesirable seats, preventing users from choosing preferred window or aisle positions [#tk_536127] [#tk_1151943]. Additionally, system errors can separate adjacent passengers or incorrectly assign seats after reservation splits [#tk_132695] [#tk_2875350]. Users also report confusion regarding upgrade list order and lack of clarity on seat restrictions at booking [#tk_1120748] [#tk_2957943]."
